#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:537
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_FerryUnavailable"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon?\n"
"You're looking for a ship?\p"
"I'm sorry, the ferry service isn't\n"
"available at present…$"
msgstr ""
"请问有什么事吗？\n"
"您是在找船吗？\p"
"非常抱歉，渡轮目前\n"
"暂停服务……$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:543
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_MayISeeYourTicket"
msgid ""
"Hello, are you here for the ferry?\n"
"May I see your TICKET?$"
msgstr ""
"您好，您是来乘坐渡轮的吗？\n"
"请出示您的船票。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:547
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_NoTicket"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} doesn't have the TICKET…\p"
"I'm terribly sorry.\p"
"You must have a TICKET to board\n"
"the ferry.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}没有船票……\p"
"非常抱歉。\p"
"必须持有船票\n"
"才能乘坐渡轮。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:553
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_FlashTicketWhereTo"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} flashed the TICKET.\p"
"Perfect! That's all you need!\p"
"And where would you like to go?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}出示了船票。\p"
"没问题！这样就可以了！\p"
"请问您要去哪里呢？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:558
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_SailAnotherTime"
msgid "Please sail with us another time!$"
msgstr "欢迎下次再来乘坐！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:561
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_SlateportItIs"
msgid "SLATEPORT CITY it is, then!$"
msgstr "那么，前往凯那市！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:564
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_BattleFrontierItIs"
msgid "BATTLE FRONTIER it is, then!$"
msgstr "那么，前往对战开拓区！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:567
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_PleaseBoard"
msgid ""
"Please board the ferry and wait for\n"
"departure.$"
msgstr ""
"请登上渡轮，\n"
"等待出发。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:571
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_WhereWouldYouLikeToGo"
msgid "Then, where would you like to go?$"
msgstr "那么，您要去哪里呢？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:574
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_SailorFerryUnavailable"
msgid ""
"Until they finish making the ferry,\n"
"we sailors have nothing to do…\p"
"I wish they'd get a move on, the folks\n"
"at the SHIPYARD in SLATEPORT.$"
msgstr ""
"在渡轮造好之前，\n"
"我们船员都没事可做……\p"
"真希望凯那市造船厂的人\n"
"能快点啊。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_Harbor/scripts.inc:580
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Harbor_Text_SailorFerryAvailable"
msgid ""
"The ferry S.S. TIDAL is finally in\n"
"operation.\p"
"The folks at the SHIPYARD in SLATEPORT\n"
"must've worked extra hard.\p"
"Well, it's my turn to get busy now!$"
msgstr ""
"渡轮潮汐号终于\n"
"开始运营了。\p"
"凯那市造船厂的人们\n"
"一定加班加点地努力了吧。\p"
"好了，现在轮到我忙起来了！$"
